  "description": "Featuring the same high-end aluminum frame and hollow chainstay yoke as the HT7 and HT5, The HT3 sports a lightweight aluminum fork as the only full rigid model in the line. Suspension, comfort and incredible traction are delivered by the new WTB Bridger and Trail Blazer tires rideable at low air pressure. 2x10 Shimano gearing, 2-pc crankset, Tektro disc brakes & tubeless ready WTB TCS wheels & tires complete a high quality package.\n6061-T6 Series alloy Hardtail frame, 27.5\" Plus / 29\" geometry, Tapered 1.5\" head tube, 73mm BB shell, 12x148mm Boost Thru-Axle dropouts\nFull Alloy fork, 1-1/8 - 1.5\" Taper alloy steerer, Boost 110mm axle w/ Q/R\nFPD DOZER headset w/ 1.5\" AC Bearing bottom cup\nSamox 2-pc 36/22T crankset, 24mm Axle, Boost 148 & 10-spd compatible\nShimano Deore 2x10 derailleurs & shifters\nShimano 10-spd 11-36T cassette\nWTB Scraper 27.5\"Plus 50mm wide, alloy double wall rims w/ TCS i45 rim tape, Tubeless ready\nWTB Bridger Comp 27.5x3.0\" front & Trail Blazer 2.8\" rear tires, TCS, Aramid 60 tpi\nPivit Boost alloy disc hubs, 32h, 110mm Q/R axle front & 12x148mThru-Axle rear",
